ncies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in 4.5.1.stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.1.stable - Linux Mint 22.2 (Zara) on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 2 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060 (nvidia; 570.195.03) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-4790K CPU @ 4.00GHz (8 threads) - 15.48 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nThere is an error in a script and editor highlights it. It can be fixed in another file by changing a method signature. I fix it, save the file, and then go back using \"History Previous\" command (usually by pressing \"Alt+Left Arrow\" or pressing \"Back/Previous button' on the mouse but selecting \"File->History Previous\" in the menu behaves the same way).\n\nI expect the error to disappear but it is still there even though it is already fixed. \n\nThe error disappears if I open another file and then go back not through the shortcut but by clicking on the file in the list of opened files. But that is time consuming and it should not be necessary.\n\nI guess that the file is not rescanned when going back using the \"History Previous\" command, only when opening it from the list of opened files.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nOpen the main.gd file in the attached MRP. There should be a syntax error:\n<img width=\"848\" height=\"241\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f8ac0969-2007-4937-a9a3-65877ab66ec8\" />\n\nOpen test.gd file and replace the `do_something` function with the one that is commented out:\n<img width=\"857\" height=\"240\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/df6717a6-a34f-447f-92a2-60420e06df48\" />\nSave the file.\n\nGo back using \"Alt + Left Arrow\" shortcut.\n\nExpected outcome: The line is no longer highlighted and the error message disappears.\nActual outcome: The line is still highlighted and the error message is displayed.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[history_previous_issue.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23745237/history_previous_issue.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113147/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113147/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}